{"version":1,"content":"<p>新皇崗口岸昨早6時半啟用。</p><p>據深圳邊檢總站統計，新口岸開通首日，由昨早6時30分至晚上12時，出入境人次7.95萬，其中入境人次4.13萬，出境人次3.82萬。</p><p>出入境車輛則有0.8萬輛次，其中入境0.42萬輛次，出境0.38萬輛次。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T03:21:50.976637+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T02:55:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:37:39.288968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T03:18:05.823147+00:00","content_hash":"f86df8520629ea2a10813adc08e20dc86d1bb616012e31fb36e9f12fb138bad8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}